  "description": "Data-source-neutral market-data primitives for futures backtesting and live trading with one shared code path: the canonical event model (Trade/Quote/Depth/Snapshot), the .sl2 binary format — a compact, roll-forward-only container for L1+L2 event streams with CRC'd compressed blocks and a stats footer — and its .sbd twin for windowed M1 bars, plus an L1+L2 order book with market-sweep and limit-queue fill primitives, time/Renko/range/activity bar builders, Symbol/Instrument/Contract identities, and a holiday-aware trade-date calendar. An idiosyncratic tool supporting SquidEyes' own work; shared as an educational project.",
